[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2728980349","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104243#issuecomment-2728980349","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104243","id":2728980349,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6iqO99","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-17T10:27:24Z","updated_at":"2025-03-17T12:03:00Z","body":"It seems that all textures in the L8 format have this issue. I save the png noise as `PortableCompressedTexture2D` in the L8 format, the srgb->linear conversion is also skipped. \n```gdscript\n@tool\nextends Node3D\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar png:Texture2D = load(\"res://texture_comparison_test_c_tex.png\")\n\tvar img :=png.get_image()\n\timg.convert(Image.FORMAT_L8)\n\tvar c:=PortableCompressedTexture2D.new()\n\tc.create_from_image(img, PortableCompressedTexture2D.COMPRESSION_MODE_LOSSLESS)\n\tResourceSaver.save(c,\"res://noise_l8.tres\")\n\n```\n[noise_l8.tres.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19284121/noise_l8.tres.zip)\n\nThe same problem with the L8 tex